The exe already contains the cockpit panel, including your toolbar icon. The other person does this:

Double-click the exe. Windows SmartScreen may say it is unrecognized because the file is not signed. More info, then Run anyway.
In Flap Happy, open settings and choose Install cockpit panel.
Restart MSFS, then press Tab and open Flap Happy.
Leave the desktop app running. The panel in the sim shows that window.
A new install also gets the AS33-18m, AS33-15m, and JS3 profiles. Profiles you have edited under %APPDATA%\FlapHappy\profiles are not inside the exe. To share one of those, send the .json file. They can drag it onto the Flap Happy window.